      <slug></slug>
      <title>IcedTea NP Plugin: the next generation Open Source Java Plugin</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Free Java</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Removal of OJI from Gecko has made it necessary to re-write the current IcedTea Plugin. The new IcedTea NP Plugin uses the newer, preferred NPRuntime API. It solves many of the issues surrounding the old plugin.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will focus on the features of the new plugin, and it&amp;#39;s advantages over the old one.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1471">Deepak Bhole</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>